// 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7. Transactions affecting and to A, B, C respectively (they
//     mean the same thing in this RPC implementation).
// 8, 9, 10. Transactions sent by A, B, C respectively.
// 11. Transactions sent by A to B.

